cable\056length\073j\053\053\051\173var index\075applicable\133j\135\054r\075rows\133index\135\174\174\173\175\054f\075c\056frases\133index\135\054cat\075r\056cat\174\174r\056c\174\174f\056cat\054nc\075r\056NC\075\075\075undefined\077weights\133cat\135\072r\056NC\054p\075r\056P\075\075\075undefined\077\050f\056P\075\075\075undefined\077c\056P\072f\056P\051\072r\056P\054w\075nc\052p\057applicable\056length\073maximum\053\075w\073var value\075r\056a\075\075\075\047S\047\077w\0720\073earned\053\075value\073contributions\133index\135\075\173earned\072value\054maximum\072w\054divisor\072applicable\056length\175\073\175\175return \173earned\072earned\054maximum\072maximum\054contributions\072contributions\175\073\175\012 function label\050c\051\173var out\075\133\135\073for\050var i\0750\073i\074\050c\056scoringGroups\174\174\133\135\051\056length\073i\053\053\051\173var names\075\133\135\073for\050var j\0750\073j\074c\056scoringGroups\133i\135\056length\073j\053\053\051names\056push\050\047F\047\053c\056scoringGroups\133i\135\133j\135\051\073out\056push\050\047m\351dia de \047\053names\056join\050\047\054 \047\051\051\073\175return out\056length\077\047Pontua\347\343o APPCC\072 \047\053out\056join\050\047\073 \047\051\053\047\056 NA sai da m\351dia\073 frases n\343o agrupadas pontuam separadamente\056\047\072\047\047\073\175\012 return \173groups\072groups\054totals\072totals\054label\072label\175\073\012\175\051\050\051\073\012\012var CFG\075\173\042itens\042\072\173\042q\137p1c1\1374\0561\0561\042\072\173\042rects\042\072\133\133175\05625\054266\05675\054213\056875\054276\05625\135\054\133214\056875\054266\05675\054253\0565\054276\05625\135\135\054\042page\042\0720\054\042col\042\0721\054\042code\042\072\0424\0561\0561\042\054\042proc\042\072\0424\0561\042\054\042allowNA\042\072false\054\042classField\042\072\042classe\137p1\1374\0561\0561\042\054\042frases\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042A \134u00e1rea circundante \134u00e0 casa de prote\134u00e7\134u00e3o da capta\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve ser pavimentada e dispor de um sistema de drenagem de \134u00e1guas pluviais de modo a impedir a infiltra\134u00e7\134u00e3o de contaminantes\054 n\134u00e3o comprometendo a qualidade sanit\134u00e1ria da \134u00e1gua mineral natural e da \134u00e1gua natural\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042P\042\0723\054\042orientacao\042\072\042Verificar integridade da pavimenta\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 funcionamento da drenagem e aus\134u00eancia de empo\134u00e7amento ou sinais de infiltra\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042consideracao\042\072\042Condi\134u00e7\134u00e3o b\134u00e1sica de estrutura\054 organiza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 pessoal ou documenta\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042providencia\042\072\042\042\054\042fundamento\042\072\042Condi\134u00e7\134u00e3o b\134u00e1sica de estrutura\054 organiza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 pessoal ou documenta\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042A \134u00e1rea circundante \134u00e0 casa de prote\134u00e7\134u00e3o da capta\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve ser mantida limpa e livre de focos de insalubridade\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042P\042\0723\054\042orientacao\042\072\042Verificar limpeza e aus\134u00eancia de focos de insalubridade\073 conferir se o POP abrange a \134u00e1rea externa e verificar registros de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042consideracao\042\072\042Condi\134u00e7\134u00e3o b\134u00e1sica de estrutura\054 organiza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 pessoal ou documenta\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042providencia\042\072\042\042\054\042fundamento\042\072\042Condi\134u00e7\134u00e3o b\134u00e1sica de estrutura\054 organiza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 pessoal ou documenta\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\175\135\054\042P\042\0723\054\042statusField\042\072\042estado\137q\137p1c1\1374\0561\0561\042\054\042resultField\042\072\042peso\137q\137p1c1\1374\0561\0561\042\054\042template\042\072\042Frases\1374\1371\1371\137S\042\054\042editorPrefix\042\072\042F\1374\1371\137